# argument                         |   type         |  require?   |   default
# .....................................................................................................
input                              |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
output                             |   string       |  optional   |   valor_splines_[BEAM]_[SAMPLE]_[PARAM].root
format                             |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
config                             |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
beam                               |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
sample                             |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
detector                           |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
systematic                         |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
modes                              |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
include-simple-binning             |   boolean      |  optional   |  false
max-events                         |   integer      |  optional   | -1
max-ereco                          |   double       |  mandatory  |   -
max-yreco                          |   double       |  mandatory  |   -
